      "rationale": "This equation defines the named Boolean summary sumFourPositiveEvens(N) as the arithmetic characterization N >= 8 and N modulo 2 == 0; it is a mathematical summary definition, not an independently established fact.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-df444b1d030ac9ca78919bfd775a5a03296a11547d9d28a09eb36785f9397593",
      "start_line": 10,
      "text": "  rule sumFourPositiveEvens(N)\n    => N >=Int 8 andBool N %Int 2 ==Int 0"
    },
    {
