      "normalized_sha256": "88b901aa7847ffb653815da50fc9ef8c784736ae52b2ae8c3a22a1e9022d78fe",
      "rationale": "This equation defines the named proof term canonicalWitnessesAreValid(N) by expanding the positivity, evenness, and sum checks for the canonical witnesses N - 6, 2, 2, 2.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-88b901aa7847ffb653815da50fc9ef8c784736ae52b2ae8c3a22a1e9022d78fe",
      "start_line": 14,
      "text": "  rule canonicalWitnessesAreValid(N)\n    => N -Int 6 >Int 0\n       andBool (N -Int 6) %Int 2 ==Int 0\n       andBool 2 >Int 0 andBool 2 %Int 2 ==Int 0\n       andBool (N -Int 6) +Int 2 +Int 2 +Int 2 ==Int N"
    }
